<!--
  ts-library — OWASP Dependency Check suppressions
  Managed by arbiter. Do not remove this file.

  MANDATORY FORMAT: every suppress block MUST be immediately preceded by a
  metadata comment with pipe-separated fields on a single line:

    reason: 10+ chars referencing a tracking issue | owner: @github-handle | expiresAt: YYYY-MM-DD | scope: CVE-or-package

  The check-suppressions.mjs gate validates all entries on every L1 commit.
  Entries with a past expiresAt fail the gate — there are no permanent suppressions.

  To add a suppression:
  1. Add the metadata comment on the line immediately before the suppress element
  2. Set expiresAt to when the upstream fix is expected (max 12 months)
  3. Reference the tracking issue in reason
-->
